{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/urbanadventours/items/39486/", "pk": 39486, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/urbanadventours/", "pk": 8471, "shortname": "urbanadventours", "name": "Urban Adventours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Electric-Assist Bike Rental", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Electric-Assist Bike Rental", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": -18.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": -18.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 17367, "description": "#Our pedal-assist electric bicycle delivers smooth and instantaneous power so you can float up hills, dial up your speed, and see Boston with the greatest of ease. These bikes have no throttle - all you have to do is pedal!\n\n**Riders must be 18+**\n\n##About\n\nAll rentals include helmets, locks, flat kits and lights.\n\nPlease call us for more information.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "103 Atlantic Ave, Boston MA", "booking_notes": "# What to Expect When You Rent a Bike\n\nRentals must be picked up and dropped off during our opening hours. \nMonday-Saturday: 9am - 6pm\nSunday: 9am-5pm\n***CLOSED for Siesta daily between 2 pm and 3 pm. Rental drop-offs and pick-ups will not be accepted during this time.***\n\n## Before You Arrive\n- Sign your waiver ahead of time (link above).\n- Bring a credit card — we take a temporary copy of your card information for security.\n\n## When You Arrive\n- Check in at **103 Atlantic Avenue**.\n- Sign a waiver if you haven’t done so online.\n- We’ll take a copy of your credit card before setting you up with your rental.\n\n## What to Bring \n\n**Your rental includes, upon request:**\n- Helmet\n- Lock\n- Lights\n- Flat repair kit\n\n**We recommend also bringing:**\n- Comfortable, weather-appropriate clothing\n- Sun protection\n- A water bottle\n\n## Can I bring the whole family?\nYes! We have a wide range of family friendly bike options available.  \nLearn more here:  \n[Which rental is best for my family?](https://www.urbanadventours.com/which-rental-is-best-for-my-family/)\n\n##Other Tips & Guidelines\n\nYou do not need to print these pages! We will have your booking information available upon your arrival.\nImportant: Any directions or maps provided by AdvenTours are only a rough guide. You are responsible for arriving at the activity's meeting location on time, so make sure to check with a second source that can provide specific directions from your starting point.\n\n## Getting to Urban AdvenTours\n\n**103 Atlantic Ave, Boston (North End)**  \nAcross from Christopher Columbus Park, near the New England Aquarium and Faneuil Hall.  \n**Closest subway stop:** Aquarium Station (Blue Line)\n\nPlease plan your route in advance.  \nWe are not able to provide turn-by-turn directions over the phone.\n\n---\n\n### Public Transit (Strongly Recommended)\nBoston traffic and parking can be difficult. Public transit is usually the easiest option.\n\n**Walking distance:**\n- 15 minutes from North Station\n- 25 minutes from South Station\n\n**Nearby subway stops:**\n- Aquarium (Blue Line) — closest\n- Haymarket (Green and Orange Lines)\n- State Street (Orange and Blue Lines)\n- Government Center (Green and Blue Lines)\n- Park Street (Green and Red Lines)\n\nPlan your trip: https://www.mbta.com\n\n---\n\n### Parking\nThere is **no street parking** at our location.\n\nNearby garages:\n- Standard Parking — 260 Commercial St | (617) 367-1681\n- Government Center Garage — 50 New Sudbury St | (617) 227-0385\n\n---\n\n### Walking Directions from Major Subway Stops\n\n**From Aquarium (Blue Line):**  \nWalk north on Atlantic Ave past Columbus Park.  \nTurn right on Atlantic Ave.\n\n**From Haymarket (Green/Orange):**  \nWalk south on Surface Rd.  \nTurn left on Mercantile St and cross the Greenway.  \nContinue onto Atlantic Ave.\n\n**From State Street (Orange/Blue):**  \nWalk east toward the water.  \nCross the Greenway and turn left.  \nWalk past Columbus Park.  \nTurn right on Atlantic Ave.\n\n**From Government Center (Green/Blue):**  \nWalk through City Hall Plaza.  \nCross Congress St.  \nWalk through Faneuil Hall/Quincy Market.  \nCross the Greenway and turn left.  \nTurn right on Atlantic Ave.\n\n\n##Map\n![Description of image](https://d1a2dkr8rai8e2.cloudfront.net/api/file/ZLurP8BCT9CpDhOfh9zx)\n\n\n#Other Activities We Recommend:\n[![Classic Harbor Line Boston](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/neInTgFHTf2lIcsdgmB6)](https://fareharbor.com/boston-sailing/?asn=fareharbor&asn-ref=urbanadventours&ref=confirmationemail)\n\n[![On Location Tours Boston](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/85E6FjSSaXULrOI0tQA2)](https://fareharbor.com/onlocationtoursboston/?asn=fareharbor&asn-ref=urbanadventours&ref=confirmationemail)\n\n[![PhotoWalks Tours](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cIQaaLYzTNuGF8g15Vd3)](https://fareharbor.com/photowalks/?asn=fareharbor&asn-ref=urbanadventours&ref=confirmationemail)", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Ages 18+", "short_description": null, "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ktvqGfZLSImDmEQp5UqV", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ktvqGfZLSImDmEQp5UqV", "images"